{% comment %}
  Main navigation — desktop mega menu (PC) + off-canvas drawer (mobile).

  Decisions in force (task-header.md, 2026-10-09 / 2026-10-12):
  - O-5: two separate DOM trees, never shared. Desktop is hover/focus-within driven;
    mobile is a native <dialog> opened with showModal() so focus trapping, background
    inert, Esc-to-close and ::backdrop come from the platform instead of hand-rolled JS.
  - O-1: sticky is PC only, and only inside the min-width media query.
  - BUG-023: a menu item that has children is a GROUP. Its url may be empty, so it must
    never be rendered as an <a> — that would emit a dead href="#" link.
  - ARIA: current page is taken from link.current / link.child_current rather than by
    comparing URL strings ourselves.
  - 2026-10-12 mega rework: top-level groups render a full-width mega panel
    (columns per second-level item, third level listed inside the column) instead of a
    narrow dropdown with a flyout. The panel spans the whole viewport width (anchored
    against the desktop row), while its inner content stays aligned to the content
    column. It slides in and out (display transition with allow-discrete, graceful
    degradation to instant hide on older browsers). Optional conversion card: a
    mega_promo section block whose "menu item" setting matches the top-level item
    title renders inside that panel. Promo text sits BELOW the image, never overlaid
    — contrast on merchant-picked imagery cannot be guaranteed (SDD §8.2).
  - 2026-10-12 second round (刘工): no dropdown chevrons on desktop. A dark sliding
    pill (assets/nav-pill.js, custom element nav-pill) follows hover/keyboard focus
    across the top-level items and hides when the pointer leaves the nav. aria-current
    stays as static brand-color text — a "you are here" cue must not vanish with the
    hover state (SDD §8.2). No-JS fallback: hovered item tints itself dark, no sliding.

  Recursion is deliberately capped at three levels (Shop > Mowers > Walk-behind).
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign menu = section.settings.menu
  assign brand_name = section.settings.brand_name | default: shop.name
  if section.settings.logo != blank
    assign logo_src = section.settings.logo | image_url: width: 160
  else
    assign logo_src = 'logo_webp.webp' | asset_url
  endif
-%}

{% comment -%}
  This section is the whole sticky header row (decision 2026-10-09, option A).

  account and cart used to be separate sections, which broke sticky: they are
  sibling nodes of this one, so the menu would pin to the viewport top while the
  cart and account icons scrolled away — leaving an unusable strip. Everything that
  belongs on the pinned row therefore lives INSIDE this section.

  Layout is three zones (logo / menu / tools). Search is an icon-only toggle in
  the tools cluster; clicking it opens a right-side drawer (the <search-drawer>
  element at the bottom of this file) that carries the full predictive search
  form — 2026-10-10 刘工 requirement: the row itself never grows a search input.

  Mobile is unaffected: it uses the drawer at the bottom of this file, which already
  renders its own account and cart copies.
{% endcomment -%}

<nav class="main-nav full-width" aria-label="{{ 'navigation.menu' | t }}">
  {%- comment -%} ---------- 桌面：吸顶整行（O-1，仅 PC） ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    data-nav-pill-anchor（第五轮，刘工）：药丸与 mega 面板约定共用的定位锚点。
    CSS 包含块由本元素自身的 position: relative 决定（样式里已写）；
    JS（nav-pill.js）量测时优先认这个属性并校验其 position——
    中间层结构变化时告警而不是静默错位。
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="main-nav__desktop" data-nav-pill-anchor>
    <div class="main-nav__inner">
      {%- comment -%}
        Zone 0: logo + brand name. Links home. The image is decorative
        (alt="") because the visible brand text already names the link.
        Falls back to the bundled logo_webp.webp when the merchant has not
        picked a logo in the editor.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <a class="main-nav__logo" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">
        <img
          class="main-nav__logo-img"
          src="{{ logo_src }}"
          alt=""
          width="40"
          height="40"
          loading="eager"
        >
        <span class="main-nav__brand">{{ brand_name }}</span>
      </a>

      {%- if menu.links.size > 0 -%}
        <nav-pill class="main-nav__list-wrap">
          <ul class="main-nav__list" role="list">
            {%- for link in menu.links -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign has_children = false
                if link.links.size > 0
                  assign has_children = true
                endif
                assign is_current = false
                if link.current
                  assign is_current = true
                endif
                assign in_branch = false
                if link.child_current or link.child_active
                  assign in_branch = true
                endif
                assign link_title = link.title | strip
              -%}

              <li
                class="main-nav__item{% if in_branch %} main-nav__item--in-branch{% endif %}{% if has_children %} main-nav__item--group{% endif %}"
              >
                {%- if has_children -%}
                  {%- comment -%}
                    分组项：只出 <span>，不输出 <a>（BUG-023）。
                    面板锚定在 .main-nav__desktop 上（整行宽、内容列对齐），
                    所以 li 自身不能创建定位上下文。
                    不带下拉箭头（2026-10-12 刘工）：选中态交给滑动药丸指示器。
                  {%- endcomment -%}
                  <span class="main-nav__link main-nav__link--group" aria-haspopup="true">
                    {{ link.title }}
                  </span>

                  {%- comment -%}
                    Mega 面板（2026-10-13 第八轮，参考 demo 截图三段式）：
                    左列 = 二级分类导航（图标走 mega_category_icon block 配置，
                    商家可配可删）；中区 = 二级分组的集合卡组（图 + 标题 +
                    真实产品数，数据走 link.object，不伪造）；右列 = promo 卡。
                    叶子二级项只在左列出链接，中区不输出空壳组。
                  {%- endcomment -%}
                  <div class="main-nav__mega">
                    <div class="main-nav__mega-inner">
                      <div class="main-nav__mega-nav">
                        <span class="main-nav__mega-label">{{ link.title }}</span>
                        <ul class="main-nav__mega-cats" role="list">
                          {%- for child in link.links -%}
                            {%- liquid
                              assign child_title = child.title | strip
                              assign icon_kind = ''
                              for block in section.blocks
                                if block.type == 'mega_category_icon' and icon_kind == ''
                                  assign wanted = block.settings.menu_item | strip
                                  if wanted == child_title
                                    assign icon_kind = block.settings.icon
                                  endif
                                endif
                              endfor
                            -%}
                            <li class="main-nav__mega-cat">
                              {%- if child.links.size > 0 -%}
                                <span
                                  class="main-nav__mega-cat-link main-nav__mega-cat-link--group{% if child.child_current or child.child_active %} main-nav__mega-cat-link--current{% endif %}"
                                  tabindex="0"
                                  data-mega-tab="{{ forloop.index }}"
                                >
                                  {%- if icon_kind != blank -%}
                                    {%- assign icon_file = icon_kind | prepend: 'icon-' | append: '.svg' -%}
                                    <span class="main-nav__mega-cat-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                      {{ icon_file | inline_asset_content }}
                                    </span>
                                  {%- endif -%}
                                  {{ child.title }}
                                </span>
                              {%- else -%}
                                <a
                                  class="main-nav__mega-cat-link{% if child.current %} main-nav__mega-cat-link--current{% endif %}"
                                  href="{{ child.url }}"
                                  tabindex="0"
                                  data-mega-tab="{{ forloop.index }}"
                                  {% if child.current %}
                                    aria-current="page"
                                  {% endif %}
                                >
                                  {%- if icon_kind != blank -%}
                                    {%- assign icon_file = icon_kind | prepend: 'icon-' | append: '.svg' -%}
                                    <span class="main-nav__mega-cat-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                      {{ icon_file | inline_asset_content }}
                                    </span>
                                  {%- endif -%}
                                  {{ child.title }}
                                </a>
                              {%- endif -%}
                            </li>
                          {%- endfor -%}
                        </ul>
                        {%- comment -%}
                          View all products（2026-10-13 刘工）：官方内置的
                          /collections/all 路由，箭头符合准则（View All 链接）。
                        {%- endcomment -%}
                        <a
                          class="main-nav__mega-viewall"
                          href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"
                        >
                          {{ 'navigation.view_all_products' | t }}
                          <span class="main-nav__mega-viewall-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
                        </a>
                      </div>

                      <div class="main-nav__mega-content">
                        {%- for child in link.links -%}
                          {%- liquid
                            assign child_title = child.title | strip
                            assign popular_collection = blank
                            for block in section.blocks
                              if block.type == 'mega_category_icon' and popular_collection == blank
                                assign wanted = block.settings.menu_item | strip
                                if wanted == child_title
                                  assign popular_collection = block.settings.popular_collection
                                endif
                              endif
                            endfor
                          -%}
                          {%- if popular_collection != blank and popular_collection.products.size > 0 -%}
                            {%- comment -%}
                              产品卡阵列（2026-10-13 刘工）：popular 集合前 3 个产品，
                              组头带 "All {集合名} (n) →" 出口（View All 型链接，箭头合规）。
                              三级链接收进组底小链接行，导航功能不丢。
                            {%- endcomment -%}
                            <div class="main-nav__mega-group" data-mega-panel="{{ forloop.index }}">
                              <div class="main-nav__mega-group-head">
                                <span class="main-nav__mega-group-title">{{ child.title }}</span>
                                <a
                                  class="main-nav__mega-group-all"
                                  href="{{ popular_collection.url }}"
                                >
                                  {{ popular_collection.title }}
                                  ({{ popular_collection.all_products_count }})
                                  <span class="main-nav__mega-group-all-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
                                </a>
                              </div>
                              <ul class="main-nav__mega-cards" role="list">
                                {%- for product in popular_collection.products limit: 3 -%}
                                  <li class="main-nav__mega-card">
                                    <a
                                      class="main-nav__mega-card-link"
                                      href="{{ product.url }}"
                                    >
                                      {%- assign card_image = product.featured_image -%}
                                      {%- if card_image != blank -%}
                                        <span class="main-nav__mega-card-media">
                                          {{
                                            card_image
                                            | image_url: width: 480
                                            | image_tag:
                                              widths: '160, 240, 360, 480',
                                              sizes: '13rem',
                                              loading: 'lazy',
                                              alt: '',
                                              class: 'main-nav__mega-card-img'
                                          }}
                                        </span>
                                      {%- else -%}
                                        <span
                                          class="main-nav__mega-card-media main-nav__mega-card-media--empty"
                                          aria-hidden="true"
                                        ></span>
                                      {%- endif -%}
                                      {%- if product.vendor != blank -%}
                                        <span class="main-nav__mega-card-vendor">{{ product.vendor }}</span>
                                      {%- endif -%}
                                      <span class="main-nav__mega-card-title">{{ product.title }}</span>
                                      <span class="main-nav__mega-card-price">
                                        {{ product.price | money }}
                                      </span>
                                    </a>
                                  </li>
                                {%- endfor -%}
                              </ul>
                              {%- if child.links.size > 0 -%}
                                <ul class="main-nav__mega-sublinks" role="list">
                                  {%- for grandchild in child.links -%}
                                    <li>
                                      <a
                                        class="main-nav__mega-sublink{% if grandchild.current %} main-nav__mega-sublink--current{% endif %}"
                                        href="{{ grandchild.url }}"
                                        {% if grandchild.current %}
                                          aria-current="page"
                                        {% endif %}
                                      >
                                        {{ grandchild.title }}
                                      </a>
                                    </li>
                                  {%- endfor -%}
                                </ul>
                              {%- endif -%}
                            </div>
                          {%- elsif child.links.size > 0 -%}
                            {%- comment -%}
                              回退：未配 popular 集合的分组二级项 → 三级集合卡组
                              （第八轮逻辑，保证没配 block 也体面）
                            {%- endcomment -%}
                            <div class="main-nav__mega-group" data-mega-panel="{{ forloop.index }}">
                              <span class="main-nav__mega-group-title">{{ child.title }}</span>
                              <ul class="main-nav__mega-cards" role="list">
                                {%- for grandchild in child.links -%}
                                  <li class="main-nav__mega-card">
                                    <a
                                      class="main-nav__mega-card-link{% if grandchild.current %} main-nav__mega-card-link--current{% endif %}"
                                      href="{{ grandchild.url }}"
                                      {% if grandchild.current %}
                                        aria-current="page"
                                      {% endif %}
                                    >
                                      {%- if grandchild.type == 'collection_link' and grandchild.object != blank -%}
                                        {%- liquid
                                          assign coll = grandchild.object
                                          assign card_image = coll.featured_image
                                          if card_image == blank
                                            assign card_image = coll.products.first.image
                                          endif
                                        -%}
                                        {%- if card_image != blank -%}
                                          <span class="main-nav__mega-card-media">
                                            {{
                                              card_image
                                              | image_url: width: 480
                                              | image_tag:
                                                widths: '160, 240, 360, 480',
                                                sizes: '13rem',
                                                loading: 'lazy',
                                                alt: '',
                                                class: 'main-nav__mega-card-img'
                                            }}
                                          </span>
                                        {%- else -%}
                                          {%- comment -%} 集合无图：色块占位，不渲染空 img {%- endcomment -%}
                                          <span
                                            class="main-nav__mega-card-media main-nav__mega-card-media--empty"
                                            aria-hidden="true"
                                          ></span>
                                        {%- endif -%}
                                        <span class="main-nav__mega-card-title">{{ grandchild.title }}</span>
                                        {%- if coll.all_products_count > 0 -%}
                                          <span class="main-nav__mega-card-count">
                                            {{ 'navigation.products_count' | t: count: coll.all_products_count }}
                                          </span>
                                        {%- endif -%}
                                      {%- else -%}
                                        {%- comment -%} 非集合链接的三级项：纯文字卡，体面降级 {%- endcomment -%}
                                        <span
                                          class="main-nav__mega-card-media main-nav__mega-card-media--empty"
                                          aria-hidden="true"
                                        ></span>
                                        <span class="main-nav__mega-card-title">{{ grandchild.title }}</span>
                                      {%- endif -%}
                                    </a>
                                  </li>
                                {%- endfor -%}
                              </ul>
                            </div>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </div>

                      {%- comment -%}
                        转化位：mega_promo block，按 menu_item 设置与一级项标题精确匹配。
                        只渲染第一个命中的 block；图与链接必填，缺一不渲染（不留空壳）。
                        文字在图下方——不叠图，对比度不赌商家自选图（SDD §8.2）。
                      {%- endcomment -%}
                      {%- assign promo_rendered = false -%}
                      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
                        {%- if promo_rendered -%}
                          {%- continue -%}
                        {%- endif -%}
                        {%- assign wanted = block.settings.menu_item | strip -%}
                        {%- if block.type == 'mega_promo'
                          and wanted == link_title
                          and block.settings.image != blank
                          and block.settings.link != blank
                        -%}
                          {%- assign promo_rendered = true -%}
                          <a
                            class="main-nav__mega-promo"
                            href="{{ block.settings.link }}"
                            {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
                          >
                            {{
                              block.settings.image
                              | image_url: width: 600
                              | image_tag:
                                widths: '240, 360, 480, 600',
                                sizes: '15rem',
                                loading: 'lazy',
                                class: 'main-nav__mega-promo-img'
                            }}
                            {%- if block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.subheading != blank -%}
                              <span class="main-nav__mega-promo-body">
                                {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
                                  <span class="main-nav__mega-promo-heading">{{ block.settings.heading }}</span>
                                {%- endif -%}
                                {%- if block.settings.subheading != blank -%}
                                  <span class="main-nav__mega-promo-subheading">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</span>
                                {%- endif -%}
                              </span>
                            {%- endif -%}
                          </a>
                        {%- endif -%}
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                {%- else -%}
                  {%- comment -%} 叶子项：才输出 <a> {%- endcomment -%}
                  <a
                    class="main-nav__link{% if is_current %} main-nav__link--current{% endif %}"
                    href="{{ link.url }}"
                    {% if is_current %}
                      aria-current="page"
                    {% endif %}
                  >
                    {{ link.title }}
                  </a>
                {%- endif -%}
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </nav-pill>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        Zone 2: tools. Rendered here (not as sibling sections) so they stay on the
        pinned row — see the file header note.

        The search toggle is icon-only (2026-10-10 刘工): the input never lives on
        the row. It opens the <search-drawer> at the bottom of this file.
        results_limit rides along into the drawer via the snippet param.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="main-nav__tools">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="main-nav__search-toggle"
          aria-label="{{ 'search.label' | t }}"
          aria-haspopup="dialog"
          data-search-drawer-open
        >
          {{ 'icon-search.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
        </button>

        {% render 'account-entry', menu: section.settings.customer_account_menu %}
        {% render 'cart-entry' %}

        {%- comment -%}
          #21 Follow on Shop. Default off: action 'follow' needs extra store config,
          and an unconfigured button is a dead control. Colours are the component's
          own — do not restyle (AGENTS.md §5).
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.settings.show_follow_on_shop and shop.customer_accounts_enabled -%}
          <div class="account__follow">
            {{ shop | login_button }}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- 移动：原生 <dialog> 抽屉 ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="main-nav__mobile">
    <button
      type="button"
      class="main-nav__burger"
      aria-label="{{ 'navigation.menu' | t }}"
      aria-haspopup="dialog"
      data-nav-drawer-open
    >
      {{ 'icon-menu.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
    </button>

    {%- comment -%} 移动端：汉堡居左、搜索图标推到最右 {%- endcomment -%}
    <button
      type="button"
      class="main-nav__search-toggle main-nav__search-toggle--mobile"
      aria-label="{{ 'search.label' | t }}"
      aria-haspopup="dialog"
      data-search-drawer-open
    >
      {{ 'icon-search.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
    </button>

    <nav-drawer>
      <dialog class="nav-drawer" data-nav-drawer aria-labelledby="nav-drawer-title">
        {%- comment -%} 内容存 <template>，首次打开才实例化（AGENTS §6） {%- endcomment -%}
        <template data-nav-drawer-template>
          <div class="nav-drawer__inner">
            <div class="nav-drawer__head">
              <h2 class="nav-drawer__title visually-hidden" id="nav-drawer-title">
                {{ 'navigation.menu' | t }}
              </h2>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="nav-drawer__close"
                aria-label="{{ 'navigation.close' | t }}"
                data-nav-drawer-close
              >
                {{ 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
              </button>
            </div>

            <ul class="nav-drawer__list" role="list">
              {%- for link in menu.links -%}
                {%- if link.links.size > 0 -%}
                  {%- comment -%}
                    details/summary：天然无 JS 可用、键盘可达，优于 JS 折叠（O-5）
                  {%- endcomment -%}
                  <li class="nav-drawer__item">
                    <details class="nav-drawer__group">
                      <summary class="nav-drawer__summary">
                        {{ link.title }}
                        {{ 'icon-chevron-down.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
                      </summary>
                      <ul class="nav-drawer__sublist" role="list">
                        {%- for child in link.links -%}
                          <li class="nav-drawer__item">
                            <a
                              class="nav-drawer__link{% if child.current %} nav-drawer__link--current{% endif %}"
                              href="{{ child.url }}"
                              {% if child.current %}
                                aria-current="page"
                              {% endif %}
                            >
                              {{ child.title }}
                            </a>
                            {%- comment -%} 第三级：仅在有子项时输出 {%- endcomment -%}
                            {%- if child.links.size > 0 -%}
                              <ul class="nav-drawer__sublist nav-drawer__sublist--deep" role="list">
                                {%- for grandchild in child.links -%}
                                  <li class="nav-drawer__item">
                                    <a
                                      class="nav-drawer__link{% if grandchild.current %} nav-drawer__link--current{% endif %}"
                                      href="{{ grandchild.url }}"
                                      {% if grandchild.current %}
                                        aria-current="page"
                                      {% endif %}
                                    >
                                      {{ grandchild.title }}
                                    </a>
                                  </li>
                                {%- endfor -%}
                              </ul>
                            {%- endif -%}
                          </li>
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </ul>
                    </details>
                  </li>
                {%- else -%}
                  <li class="nav-drawer__item">
                    <a
                      class="nav-drawer__link{% if link.current %} nav-drawer__link--current{% endif %}"
                      href="{{ link.url }}"
                      {% if link.current %}
                        aria-current="page"
                      {% endif %}
                    >
                      {{ link.title }}
                    </a>
                  </li>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>

            {%- comment -%}
              #22 要求 <shopify-account> 移动端也可见。抽屉内容虽存于 <template>
              （首次打开才实例化），组件本身仍在 DOM 中、可被平台脚本识别，
              因此不违反"移动端可见"。复用 account-entry snippet，不复制组件。
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="nav-drawer__footer">
              {%- if shop.customer_accounts_enabled -%}
                {% render 'account-entry', class: 'account--in-drawer' %}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- comment -%}
                cart 入口复用同一 snippet（本期为跳转链接，非按钮——见 T-1.6）。
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {% render 'cart-entry', class: 'cart-entry--in-drawer' %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </template>
      </dialog>
    </nav-drawer>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    ---------- 搜索抽屉（桌面 + 移动共用，2026-10-10 刘工） ----------
    行上只有图标；点击后从屏幕右侧滑出本抽屉，完整搜索功能都在抽屉里。
    内容存 <template> 首次打开才实例化（AGENTS §6）；实例化后 predictive-search
    自定义元素自动升级，联想逻辑不变。openers 由 search-drawer.js 通过
    [data-search-drawer-open] 在最近的 nav 里查找（桌面 + 移动两枚按钮共用）。

    ⚠️ BUG-029：本元素必须挂在 <nav> 直接子级。曾误放进 .main-nav__mobile，
    桌面端该容器 display:none——showModal() 照样成功（[open]、scroll-lock、
    背景 inert 都生效，滚动条消失 + 页面右移），但祖先 display:none 时
    dialog 不生成盒子，抽屉永远不可见。top layer 救不了 display:none 祖先。
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <search-drawer>
    <dialog class="search-drawer" data-search-drawer aria-labelledby="search-drawer-title">
      <template data-search-drawer-template>
        <div class="search-drawer__inner">
          <div class="search-drawer__head">
            <h2 class="search-drawer__title" id="search-drawer-title">
              {{ 'search.label' | t }}
            </h2>
            <button
              type="button"
              class="search-drawer__close"
              aria-label="{{ 'navigation.close' | t }}"
              data-search-drawer-close
            >
              {{ 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="search-drawer__body">
            {% render 'predictive-search-entry',
              search_section_id: section.id,
              results_limit: section.settings.results_limit
            %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </template>
    </dialog>
  </search-drawer>
</nav>

<script src="{{ 'nav-pill.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'nav-drawer.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'predictive-search.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'search-drawer.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% stylesheet %}
  .main-nav {
    position: relative;
    /* 根节点带 full-width：整行通栏，背景铺满视口（BUG-032 sticky 配套）。
       内容行不在这里加 padding——由 __inner 对齐页面内容列（见下）。 */
  }

  /* 三段布局：logo / 菜单 / 工具。
     grid 而非 flex——菜单长度随商家配置变化，flex 下工具区会被挤压。
     white-space: nowrap（2026-10-10 刘工）：导航行内任何内容都不换行，
     菜单项 / 品牌名超出时只压缩中间列宽度，不折行。
     行宽对齐 .shopify-section 的内容列（--content-width 从包裹层继承），
     与下方各 section 的文案同一列线。 */
  .main-nav__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    max-inline-size: var(--content-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    /* 行的上下 padding 由 li 承担（BUG-034，见 .main-nav__item 注释），
       inner 自身不加 padding-block——否则 trigger 与面板之间出现 hover 盲区 */
    /* 注意：inner 不能创建 stacking context（position+z-index）——
       mega 是 inner 的后代，一旦被兜进它的层叠上下文，"面板从行下
       滑出"就永远做不出来（层级被 inner 整体抬走）。第五轮结论。 */
  }

  /* Zone 0: logo + 品牌名。图标与文字并排一行，永不换行。 */
  .main-nav__logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .main-nav__logo-img {
    inline-size: 2.5rem;
    block-size: 2.5rem;
  }

  .main-nav__brand {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }

  .main-nav__tools {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* 搜索切换按钮：行上只放图标（2026-10-10 刘工），点击开抽屉 */
  .main-nav__search-toggle {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    /* 触摸目标 ≥ 44×44（AGENTS §8） */
    inline-size: 44px;
    block-size: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .main-nav__search-toggle svg {
    inline-size: 1.25rem;
    block-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .main-nav__search-toggle:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  /* 菜单列包裹层（<nav-pill>）：菜单在中间列内居中。
     注意不能加 position: relative——它和 ul 的定位都会劫持 mega 面板的
     包含块（面板会缩到菜单宽度而不是整行宽）；药丸定位用 JS 量测
     getBoundingClientRect，不依赖 CSS 锚点（2026-10-12 第五轮）。 */
  .main-nav__list-wrap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .main-nav__list {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    /* 不用 gap（2026-10-12 第三轮，刘工）：条目之间的空隙是 hover 盲区，
       鼠标扫过时药丸会停在上一个目标上。间距改由链接自身水平 padding 提供，
       相邻项 hover 区域无缝衔接，药丸滑动连贯。 */
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  /* BUG-034（2026-10-13 刘工）：行 padding 不能放在 inner 上——
     li 只包住 trigger（44px），inner 的 padding-block 会在 trigger 与
     mega 面板之间造出 16px"死亡区"（既不在 li 内也不在面板内），
     鼠标穿过时 hover 链断掉、面板自动收起。padding 移到 li 自身：
     li 高度覆盖整行，hover 链从 trigger 无缝延续到面板。 */
  /* 注意：这里不能写 position: relative——mega 面板锚定在 .main-nav__desktop
     上（整行宽），li 一旦创建定位上下文，面板就会缩回单项宽度。 */
  .main-nav__item {
    min-inline-size: 0;
    padding-block: 1rem;
  }

  .main-nav__link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    /* 链接自身抬层（z-index 1）垫在药丸之上——ul/wrap 去定位后（第五轮，
       为 mega 让出锚点），分层职责收拢到链接自身 */
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    /* 水平 padding 承担条目间距（2026-10-12 第三轮）：padding 计入 trigger 的
       测量范围，药丸覆盖整宽，hover 区域与药丸完全重合 */
    padding-inline: 1rem;
    /* 触摸目标 ≥ 44×44（AGENTS §8） */
    min-height: 44px;
    padding-block: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    cursor: pointer;
    /* 反色随药丸滑动同步过渡 */
    transition: color 0.18s ease;
  }

  /* 焦点态必须可见（SDD §8.2）。下拉靠 :focus-within 展开，但展开不等于
     有可见指示——键盘用户需要知道自己在哪一项上。 */
  .main-nav__link:focus-visible,
  .main-nav__logo:focus-visible,
  .nav-drawer__link:focus-visible,
  .nav-drawer__summary:focus-visible,
  .main-nav__burger:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  /* 当前页（2026-10-12 第二轮）：品牌色文字。深色药丸改由滑动指示器承担
     hover 反馈，但静态"你在哪"不能跟着悬浮态一起消失（SDD §8.2 / aria-current），
     所以当前页降为文字色指示，不再用药丸底色。 */
  .main-nav__link--current,
  .main-nav__item--in-branch > .main-nav__link {
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }

  /* ---- 滑动药丸指示器（2026-10-12 第二轮，配 assets/nav-pill.js） ----
     深色药丸滑动跟随 hover / 键盘焦点，鼠标离开整个导航区即隐藏还原。
     JS（nav-pill--ready）接管时链接自身不出底色，文字反色由下方规则处理。 */
  .main-nav__pill {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-foreground);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, width 0.25s ease, height 0.25s ease, opacity 0.15s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .main-nav__pill--on {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* JS 接管后：悬浮 / 焦点项文字反色（药丸垫底）。
     深灰底白字 12.63:1（T-2.2 实测值），品牌色文字项同样被覆盖反色。 */
  .nav-pill--ready .main-nav__item:hover > .main-nav__link,
  .nav-pill--ready .main-nav__item:focus-within > .main-nav__link {
    color: var(--color-background);
  }

  /* 无 JS 降级：custom element 未升级时，hover/focus 项自身显深色药丸（无滑动），
     mega 面板展开不受影响。 */
  .main-nav__list-wrap:not(.nav-pill--ready) .main-nav__item:hover > .main-nav__link,
  .main-nav__list-wrap:not(.nav-pill--ready) .main-nav__item:focus-within > .main-nav__link {
    color: var(--color-background);
    background-color: var(--color-foreground);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .main-nav__pill,
    .main-nav__mega,
    .main-nav__mega-inner,
    .main-nav__mega-group,
    .main-nav__mega-card-img,
    .main-nav__desktop::after {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  /* ---- Mega 面板（2026-10-12 第五轮）：通栏、整面板滑入滑出、层级行下面 ----
     锚定 .main-nav__desktop（整行宽），内容区由 inner 对齐内容列。
     "在导航层级之下滑入"用 clip-path 揭示实现：面板固定在行下方，
     隐藏态从顶部裁到 0 高（裁切边缘贴着行底边），展开时向下揭示——
     视觉上就是面板从导航行底下抽出，且不需要任何 z-index 层游戏
     （层游戏做过一版被否：inner 抬层会创建层叠上下文把面板兜住）。
     内容位移（inner 的 translate）叠加在揭示上，强化"滑"的动感。
     展开纯 CSS：hover / focus-within，无 JS 依赖（T-1.3 底线不变）。 */
  .main-nav__mega {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    inset-inline: 0;
    z-index: 10;
    /* 通栏实底：与导航行同色，底部圆角；阴影用 drop-shadow——
       box-shadow 画在盒外，会被 clip-path 一并裁掉；drop-shadow
       基于裁切后的形状绘制，静止与动画中都可见 */
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 18px 32px rgb(0 0 0 / 16%));
    /* 面板紧贴导航行（无缝隙）；露出的行界靠细线分隔 */
    border-block-start: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 8%);
    /* 整面板滑入滑出：隐藏态 = 从底部裁掉 100%（只留贴行的一条缝），
       展开态 = 完整。裁切边始终贴着行底边 → "从行下钻出"。
       display 的显隐用 allow-discrete 延迟到动画播完再摘除；
       旧浏览器不支持时忽略该单独声明——揭示动画保留（关闭瞬时） */
    clip-path: inset(0 0 100% 0);
    transition: clip-path 0.25s ease, display 0.25s;
    transition-behavior: allow-discrete;
  }

  .main-nav__item--group:hover > .main-nav__mega,
  .main-nav__item--group:focus-within > .main-nav__mega {
    display: block;
    clip-path: inset(0 0 -3rem 0);
  }

  @starting-style {
    .main-nav__item--group:hover > .main-nav__mega,
    .main-nav__item--group:focus-within > .main-nav__mega {
      clip-path: inset(0 0 100% 0);
    }
  }

  /* 内容区：只管对齐内容列，视觉（底色/投影/圆角）全在通栏面板上。
     位移与面板揭示同步：从 -0.75rem 滑到 0，"抽出"的动感主要来自这里。 */
  .main-nav__mega-inner {
    max-inline-size: var(--content-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    padding: 2.25rem 2.5rem;
    translate: 0 -0.75rem;
    transition: translate 0.25s ease;
    /* 导航行的不换行约定只属于行本身——面板里的产品名/价格必须可换行
       （2026-10-13 刘工：卡内文字溢出）。左列分类名单独恢复 nowrap。 */
    white-space: normal;
  }

  .main-nav__item--group:hover > .main-nav__mega .main-nav__mega-inner,
  .main-nav__item--group:focus-within > .main-nav__mega .main-nav__mega-inner {
    translate: 0 0;
  }

  /* ---- 页面背景模糊遮罩（2026-10-12 第七轮，刘工，apple.com 风格） ----
     mega 展开时行下方整屏"暗化 + backdrop blur"。
     挂在 desktop::after 而非 mega——mega 有 clip-path，会把伪元素一起裁掉。
     top:100% 从行底向下延伸一屏：不盖导航行（行文字保持清晰），
     sticky 吸顶时随行走，始终覆盖可视页面区域。
     显示条件与 mega 完全一致（hover / focus-within），用 :has() 上溯表达。
     pointer-events: none：纯视觉层，不拦截页面交互；
     面板关闭仍由"鼠标离开导航列表"驱动。 */
  .main-nav__desktop::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    inset-inline: 0;
    block-size: 100vh;
    /* mega(10) 之下、页面内容之上 */
    z-index: 5;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-color: rgb(0 0 0 / 25%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    /* visibility 离散过渡：淡出播完才真正隐藏，避免残影闪断 */
    transition: opacity 0.25s ease, visibility 0.25s;
  }

  .main-nav__desktop:has(.main-nav__item--group:hover)::after,
  .main-nav__desktop:has(.main-nav__item--group:focus-within)::after {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
  }

  /* ---- 面板三段（2026-10-13 第八轮，参考 demo）：分类列 / 内容区 / promo ---- */
  .main-nav__mega-nav {
    flex: 0 0 12rem;
    /* 左列纵向排布：分类列表在上，View all 出口压到底部 */
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-self: stretch;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-label {
    display: block;
    /* 顶部三区对齐（2026-10-13 刘工）：去 0.25rem 顶距；
       0.125rem 是小字 cap 高度补偿（1.125rem 组标题的行盒顶留白更大，
       小字需微沉才与大字字面齐线），真机不满意再微调 */
    padding-block: 0.125rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 60%, transparent);
    /* 与搜索抽屉标题同款工业小标签风格；对比度 5.74:1（T-2.2 实测） */
  }

  .main-nav__mega-cats {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.125rem;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-cat-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    min-height: 44px;
    /* 触控目标 ≥44（AGENTS §8）；行高由 min-height 保证 */
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 62%, transparent);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
    /* 分类名短，不折行（面板整体已恢复 normal） */
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-cat-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  /* 左列激活分类（第九轮补，JS 切换）：深色加粗，对齐 demo 默认选中项 */
  .main-nav__mega-cat-link--active {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-cat-link--current {
    color: var(--color-brand);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* 面板切换：hidden 属性的 UA 默认 display:none 已生效，
     这里显式兜底防未来 display 规则覆盖；无 JS（未升级）时不加 hidden，
     全部组可见——底线不破 */
  .main-nav__list-wrap.nav-mega-tabs--ready .main-nav__mega-group[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  /* 切换过渡（2026-10-13 刘工：0.45s + 位移）：新组从下方 0.5rem 浮入 + 淡入。
     只做单侧入场——两组都在文档流里，旧组若延迟消失会布局跳动。
     @starting-style 不支持的浏览器降级瞬时显隐。 */
  .main-nav__list-wrap.nav-mega-tabs--ready .main-nav__mega-group {
    opacity: 1;
    translate: 0 0;
    transition:
      opacity 0.45s ease,
      translate 0.45s ease;
  }

  @starting-style {
    .main-nav__list-wrap.nav-mega-tabs--ready .main-nav__mega-group:not([hidden]) {
      opacity: 0;
      translate: 0 0.5rem;
    }
  }

  /* 图标线框随文字色走（svg 内 stroke=currentColor，尺寸由 CSS 控制） */
  .main-nav__mega-cat-icon {
    display: flex;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-cat-icon svg {
    /* 图标比文字大一点（2026-10-13 刘工）：文字 0.9375rem，图标 1.75rem */
    inline-size: 1.75rem;
    block-size: 1.75rem;
  }

  /* 中区：二级分组的集合卡组，纵向堆叠（无切换依赖，无 JS 可用） */
  .main-nav__mega-content {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-inline-size: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.25rem;
    align-content: start;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-group-title {
    display: block;
    padding-block: 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-cards {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    /* 12rem 下限（2026-10-13 刘工：仍紧凑压抑——卡更宽、间距更大），
       每行少一张卡换呼吸感 */
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(12rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* 等高卡：li 是 grid item（默认 stretch 等行高），link 拉满列向，
     价格/计数用 auto margin 沉底——内容差异不影响卡底色高度 */
  .main-nav__mega-card {
    display: flex;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-card-link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 100%;
    text-decoration: none;
    /* 浅色卡底 + 圆角（2026-10-13 刘工）：前景 4% 叠加，深浅主题都成立；
       hover 微加深提示可点 */
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 4%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    /* 内距放宽（刘工：视觉拥挤）——图与文字、文字行间都拉开 */
    padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem 1rem;
    transition:
      background-color 0.15s ease,
      translate 0.15s ease;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-card-link:hover {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 7%, transparent);
    translate: 0 -2px;
  }

  /* 图在卡内上缘，跟随卡圆角内缩 */
  .main-nav__mega-card-media {
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 6%, transparent);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-card-media--empty {
    /* 集合无图占位：色块内嵌一圈极淡描边，读作"图位"而不是破图 */
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 12%, transparent);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-card-img {
    inline-size: 100%;
    block-size: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  /* 产品图 hover 动画：图片缩放 + 标题着色（2026-10-13 刘工） */
  .main-nav__mega-card-link:hover .main-nav__mega-card-img,
  .main-nav__mega-card-link:focus-visible .main-nav__mega-card-img {
    transform: scale(1.06);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-card-title {
    display: block;
    margin-block-start: 0.625rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-card-link:hover .main-nav__mega-card-title {
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-card-count {
    display: block;
    /* auto margin 沉底（等高卡，与 price 同机制） */
    margin-block-start: auto;
    padding-block-start: 0.375rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 62%, transparent);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-card-link--current .main-nav__mega-card-title {
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }

  /* 左列底部 View all 出口（2026-10-13 刘工）：/collections/all 官方路由。
     箭头符合准则（View All 链接）。 */
  .main-nav__mega-viewall {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-block-start: auto;
    padding-block: 0.75rem;
    border-block-start: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 12%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-viewall:hover {
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-viewall-arrow {
    transition: translate 0.15s ease;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-viewall:hover .main-nav__mega-viewall-arrow {
    translate: 0.25rem 0;
  }

  /* 组头：分类名（左）+ All 集合出口（右，View All 型链接，箭头合规） */
  .main-nav__mega-group-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-group-all {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    min-height: 44px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 62%, transparent);
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-group-all:hover {
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-group-all-arrow {
    transition: translate 0.15s ease;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-group-all:hover .main-nav__mega-group-all-arrow {
    translate: 0.25rem 0;
  }

  /* 产品卡：名称与价格同行（demo 同款） */
  .main-nav__mega-card-price {
    display: block;
    /* auto margin 沉底（等高卡），0.375rem 是与标题的最小间距 */
    margin-block-start: auto;
    padding-block-start: 0.375rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 80%, transparent);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-card-vendor {
    display: block;
    margin-block-start: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 62%, transparent);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-card-vendor + .main-nav__mega-card-title {
    margin-block-start: 0.25rem;
  }

  /* 组底三级小链接行：popular 阵列模式下三级入口不丢 */
  .main-nav__mega-sublinks {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.25rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-sublink {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 62%, transparent);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-sublink:hover {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-sublink--current {
    color: var(--color-brand);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-cat-link:focus-visible,
  .main-nav__mega-card-link:focus-visible,
  .main-nav__mega-promo:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  /* 转化位卡片：图上文下（不叠图——商家自选图上无法保证文字对比度） */
  .main-nav__mega-promo {
    flex: 0 0 15rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-promo-img {
    inline-size: 100%;
    block-size: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-promo-body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem 1rem;
  }

  .main-nav__mega-promo-heading {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .main-nav__mega-promo-subheading {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 70%, transparent);
  }

  /* promo 定宽在先（flex 0 0 15rem），中区吃剩余空间（flex 1 1 auto 已保证） */

  /* 桌面区：默认显示（桌面优先），只在移动端隐藏。
     必须有实底——否则吸顶时页面内容会透过菜单透出来。
     position: relative 是 mega 面板的锚点（整行宽），不能移到 li / ul 上。 */
  .main-nav__desktop {
    position: relative;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }

  /* 移动端抽屉相关：桌面隐藏汉堡与 dialog */
  .main-nav__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* ---- 抽屉：<dialog> + scroll-lock 锁背景（critical.css 已配套） ---- */
  .nav-drawer {
    inset-block: 0;
    inset-inline: auto 0;
    /* 由 showModal() 置于 top layer，无需 z-index */
    width: min(22rem, 88vw);
    max-width: none;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-inline-end: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 12%);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
  }

  .nav-drawer::backdrop {
    background-color: rgb(0 0 0 / 45%);
  }

  /* ---- 搜索抽屉：右侧滑出，桌面 + 移动共用（2026-10-10 刘工） ----
     结构与 nav-drawer 同款（原生 <dialog> + showModal + template 惰性实例化），
     差异只有宽度与内部排版。 */
  .search-drawer {
    inset-block: 0;
    inset-inline: auto 0;
    /* 由 showModal() 置于 top layer，无需 z-index */
    /* 宽度（2026-10-10 刘工：最小 600px）：窄屏用 92vw 兜底，≥600px 时锁 600 起 */
    width: max(600px, min(40rem, 92vw));
    max-width: none;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-inline-end: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 12%);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
  }

  /* 竖屏手机：全宽（600px 下限在手机上必然溢出） */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .search-drawer {
      width: 100vw;
    }
  }

  .search-drawer::backdrop {
    background-color: rgb(0 0 0 / 45%);
  }

  .search-drawer__inner {
    /* 纵向 flex：head 固定，body（含结果面板）吃满剩余高度。
       结果多时滚动只发生在列表上，dialog 自身不再出滚动条。 */
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .search-drawer__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .search-drawer__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-block-end: 0.5rem;
  }

  .search-drawer__title {
    margin: 0;
    /* 工业小标签风格：与结果分组标题同款（uppercase + 大字距） */
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 45%);
  }

  .search-drawer__close {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    inline-size: 44px;
    block-size: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    color: inherit;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .search-drawer__close:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .search-drawer__close svg {
    inline-size: 1.25rem;
    block-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  /* ---- 抽屉滑入 / 滑出动画（nav + search 两个抽屉同款） ----
     @starting-style + allow-discrete：开 → 从屏外滑入；关 → 等滑动完再摘除。
     旧浏览器不支持时降级为瞬时显隐，无功能损失（渐进增强）。
     translate 是物理属性：本主题仅 en（LTR），100% 恒为屏外右侧。 */
  .nav-drawer,
  .search-drawer {
    translate: 100% 0;
    transition: translate 0.25s ease, display 0.25s allow-discrete, overlay 0.25s allow-discrete;
  }

  .nav-drawer[open],
  .search-drawer[open] {
    translate: 0 0;
  }

  @starting-style {
    .nav-drawer[open],
    .search-drawer[open] {
      translate: 100% 0;
    }
    .nav-drawer[open]::backdrop,
    .search-drawer[open]::backdrop {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  /* 遮罩同步淡入淡出 */
  .nav-drawer::backdrop,
  .search-drawer::backdrop {
    opacity: 1;
    transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
  }

  @starting-style {
  }

  /* WCAG 2.1 / SDD §8.2：用户要求减少动效时全部关闭 */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .nav-drawer,
    .search-drawer,
    .nav-drawer::backdrop,
    .search-drawer::backdrop {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  /* 抽屉宽度即输入框宽度（snippet 已无 32rem 上限，此规则留作宽度解耦的文档锚点） */

  .nav-drawer__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 100%;
  }

  .nav-drawer__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border-block-end: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 12%);
  }

  .nav-drawer__close {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    color: inherit;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .nav-drawer__close svg {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
  }

  .nav-drawer__list,
  .nav-drawer__sublist {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .nav-drawer__summary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }

  /* details 默认标记在各浏览器表现不一，统一去掉 */
  .nav-drawer__summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .nav-drawer__summary svg {
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 0.75rem;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .nav-drawer__group[open] > .nav-drawer__summary svg {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .nav-drawer__link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem 0.5rem 2rem;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .nav-drawer__link--current {
    color: var(--color-brand);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .nav-drawer__sublist--deep .nav-drawer__link {
    padding-inline-start: 3rem;
  }

  /* 抽屉底部固定区：账户入口 + （后续）购物车入口 */
  .nav-drawer__footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-block-start: auto;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-block-start: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 12%);
  }

  /* 抽屉内账户组件的 sheet 从抽屉顶部弹出，与桌面端不同 */
  .account--in-drawer .account__component {
    --shopify-account-dialog-position-top: 0;
  }

  /* 抽屉内购物车入口与桌面端同结构，仅确保徽标不压到抽屉边缘 */
  .cart-entry--in-drawer .cart-entry__link {
    min-inline-size: 44px;
  }

  /* ---- 断点：以下为移动端 ---- */
  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .main-nav__desktop {
      display: none;
    }

    .main-nav__mobile {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      /* 移动导航行上下 16px，与桌面行一致（第六轮） */
      padding-block: 1rem;
    }

    /* 汉堡居左，搜索图标推到最右 */
    .main-nav__search-toggle--mobile {
      margin-inline-start: auto;
    }

    .main-nav__burger {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      padding: 0;
      color: inherit;
      background: none;
      border: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .main-nav__burger svg {
      width: 1.5rem;
      height: 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  /* ---- O-1：sticky 仅 PC，务必留在本媒体查询内 ----
     BUG-032：sticky 不能挂在 .main-nav 上——它的父级是 Shopify 生成的
     .shopify-section 包裹层，高度只有导航行自身，sticky 没有可黏的滚动余量。
     必须挂在包裹层（schema "class": "main-nav-section"）上：包裹层是 body
     （flex 列）的直接子项、纵贯整页，sticky 才有作用空间。 */
  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .main-nav-section {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
    }

    /* 桌面端汉堡与抽屉不出现；桌面区是唯一可见部分 */
    .main-nav__desktop {
      display: block;
    }
  }

  /* ============ 账户与购物车（方案 A：与菜单同处吸顶行） ============
     原 account.liquid / cart-entry.liquid 的样式随 section 合并至此——
     那两个 section 已不再是独立节点（否则 sticky 只黏住菜单，图标会滑走）。 */

  .cart-entry__link {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    /* 触摸目标 ≥ 44×44（AGENTS §8） */
    min-inline-size: 44px;
    min-block-size: 44px;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .cart-entry__link svg {
    inline-size: 1.5rem;
    block-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* 徽标绝对定位：脱离文档流，将来加购更新计数时入口尺寸不变（避免 CLS） */
  .cart-entry__count {
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-start: 2px;
    inset-inline-end: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    /* 视觉小，但数字不被压缩；两位数会自动横向撑开（border-radius 999px 不会破形） */
    min-inline-size: 1.125rem;
    block-size: 1.125rem;
    padding-inline: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-background);
    background-color: var(--color-brand);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .cart-entry__link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .account {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  /* Only CSS variables and ::part() — never restructure the component (see header note). */
  .account__component {
    --shopify-account-avatar-size: 1.75rem;
    --shopify-account-radius-base: var(--style-border-radius-inputs);
    --shopify-account-color-accent: var(--color-brand);
    --shopify-account-color-background: var(--color-background);
    --shopify-account-color-text: var(--color-foreground);
    --shopify-account-font-body: var(--font-primary--family);
    --shopify-account-font-heading: var(--font-primary--family);
    /* Sheet opens below the header, not at the very top of the viewport */
    --shopify-account-dialog-position-top: 3.5rem;
  }

  /* 触摸目标 ≥ 44×44（AGENTS §8）：组件默认头像小于此，用伪元素把命中区扩到 44px。
     负 50% 是相对自身尺寸的居中，与书写方向无关（inline-start 已是逻辑轴）。 */
  .account__component::part(signed-out-avatar) {
    position: relative;
  }

  .account__component::part(signed-out-avatar)::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-start: 50%;
    inset-inline-start: 50%;
    inline-size: 44px;
    block-size: 44px;
    translate: -50% -50%;
  }

  .account__avatar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    inline-size: 1.75rem;
    block-size: 1.75rem;
    /* 图标随前景色走，不硬编码色值（AGENTS §6） */
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .account__avatar svg {
    inline-size: 100%;
    block-size: 100%;
  }

  /* Follow on Shop 按钮保持组件自带配色，只调间距 */
  .account__follow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.main_nav",
  "class": "main-nav-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "logo",
      "label": "t:labels.logo",
      "info": "t:labels.logo_info"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "brand_name",
      "label": "t:labels.brand_name",
      "default": "Northbark"
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "menu",
      "label": "t:labels.menu",
      "default": "main-menu"
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "customer_account_menu",
      "label": "t:labels.customer_account_menu",
      "default": "customer-account-main-menu"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_follow_on_shop",
      "label": "t:labels.follow_on_shop",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "results_limit",
      "label": "t:labels.results_limit",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 10,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 10
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "mega_category_icon",
      "name": "t:general.mega_category_icon",
      "limit": 10,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "menu_item",
          "label": "t:labels.mega_category_menu_item",
          "info": "t:labels.mega_category_menu_item_info"
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "icon",
          "label": "t:labels.category_icon",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "none",
              "label": "t:options.category_icon.none"
            },
            {
              "value": "mower",
              "label": "t:options.category_icon.mower"
            },
            {
              "value": "chainsaw",
              "label": "t:options.category_icon.chainsaw"
            },
            {
              "value": "trimmer",
              "label": "t:options.category_icon.trimmer"
            },
            {
              "value": "accessories",
              "label": "t:options.category_icon.accessories"
            }
          ],
          "default": "none"
        },
        {
          "type": "collection",
          "id": "popular_collection",
          "label": "t:labels.mega_popular_collection",
          "info": "t:labels.mega_popular_collection_info"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "mega_promo",
      "name": "t:general.mega_promo",
      "limit": 3,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "menu_item",
          "label": "t:labels.mega_menu_item",
          "info": "t:labels.mega_menu_item_info"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "t:labels.image"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "t:labels.heading"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "subheading",
          "label": "t:labels.subheading"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "link",
          "label": "t:labels.link"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 13,
  "enabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
